Z||000000||Jncomutt||12-26-2001||09:15 PM||||OK.. Well I'm replacing some of the components of my front suspension, and I noticed one of my shocks is bleeding.  I only know about the major brands:  KYB, Koni, Bilstein, Tokiko, Monroe...  I like the Koni but they are too pricy.  I don't think Bilstein or Tokiko make them for Fiero, And I'm thinking that the Monroe may not be as high perf. as the KYB.  So, I'm thinking KYB may be the way to go as of right now... Any expieriences with these or any other recommndations I can look into???||||reg||1
