Z||000003||Banzai||12-27-2001||07:56 AM||||Is the rest of your suspension stock?  I have the KYBs with Eibachs and full Poly. The ride's a little harsh but I had to spray the drivers side window with Pam to make it easier to peel my cheek off the glass in right hand turns. I can't wait to get some race rubber!!<P>Banzai !!!!!!!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000004||Oreif||12-27-2001||11:04 AM||||KYB's are excellent unless you want to be able to adjust the suspesnion. KONI makes adjustable's these are nice but more $$$. KYB's work excellent with the stock suspension.||||reg||1
